["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">取り除く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とりのぞく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">除去；移除；卸载；分离</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"154974\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>庭<rp>(</rp><rt>にわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>雑草<rp>(</rp><rt>ざっそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>除<rp>(</rp><rt>のぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我把草从花园里拿出来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">取り引き</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とりひき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">交易；往来；生意</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214004\">ぜひ<ruby>取引<rp>(</rp><rt>とりひき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>させていただきたいと<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>います。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我希望你能做交易。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">取り巻く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とりまく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">围绕；包围；环绕；奉承；讨好；献殷勤</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"77258\"><ruby>老年<rp>(</rp><rt>ろうねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>死<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>巻<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かれている<ruby>島<rp>(</rp><rt>しま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">老年人是被死亡包围的岛屿。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">取り混ぜる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とりまぜる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">混合；混在一起</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">取り戻す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とりもどす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">取回；夺回；恢复；收复；挽回</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"166736\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちは、<ruby>失<rp>(</rp><rt>うしな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った<ruby>時間<rp>(</rp><rt>じかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>戻<rp>(</rp><rt>もど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さなくてはならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们必须恢复失去的时间。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">取り寄せる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とりよせる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">订购；邮购；叫人送来；拉近；拽近</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227085\">お<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>寄<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せいたしましょうか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我可以带你来吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">とりわけ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">尤其；特别</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>今年<rp>(</rp><rt>ことし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>夏<rp>(</rp><rt>なつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はとりわけ<ruby>暑<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">今年夏天特别热。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">取る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">拿；拿起；抓住；捉住；握住；递；传；给；得到；获得；取得；赢得；收到；获利；休（假）；采取；采纳；选择；采用；除去；去掉；脱掉；卸下；夺走；偷；抢；吃；进食；服用（维生素等）；采摘；采集；挤榨；捕捉；收割；占用；占据；花费；预留；留出；预留；预订；保留；搁置；保管；理解；领会；领悟；把握；诠释；记录；记下；订阅；订购；购买；取得；订购；让人送来；征收；罚款；收费；征税；娶；收为；收养；接纳；录用；掌控；把持；操纵；参加比赛；进行对战；对弈</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213310\">そのお<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいざというときのために<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っておくよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我会把这笔钱拿到你需要的时候。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">捕る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">捕捉（野生动物、鱼、昆虫、棒球等）；抓获</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"96182\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>捕<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>立<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ての<ruby>魚<rp>(</rp><rt>さかな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>朝市<rp>(</rp><rt>あさいち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってくれる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们在市场上卖掉捕鱼。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">採る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">采纳（方法、提议等）；采取（措施、行动等）；决定；采摘（如花朵）；采集（如蘑菇）；捕捉（如昆虫）；提取（如果汁）；取样（如样品）；采取（态度）；摆出（姿态）；招收（工人、学生）；录用；引入（如水）；透入（如窗户的光线）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223901\">このカップに<ruby>尿<rp>(</rp><rt>にょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をとってください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请在这个杯子里尿。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">撮る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">拍摄；拍照；录制；录音；录像；拍摄</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"184902\"><ruby>外<rp>(</rp><rt>そと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>からなら<ruby>撮<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってもかまいません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">从外面拍照就没问题了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">取れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（按钮、把手、盖子等）脱落；松开；（发热、疼痛、肿胀等）消退；消失；（污渍）褪去；（灰尘等）脱落；（皱纹等）消除；被收获；被采摘；被生产；（鱼等）被捕获；被获得；被提取；被解释为；被理解为；被看作；（平衡、和谐等）得以实现；得以达成；能够获得；能够得到；能够取得；能够赢得；能够捕到</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227468\">オリーブの<ruby>実<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>油<rp>(</rp><rt>あぶら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">可以从橄榄的果实中取出油。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">トレーニング</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">训练；练习；锻炼；健身训练；力量训练</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"108264\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>筋肉<rp>(</rp><rt>きんにく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をつけるためにトレーニングしている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他正在训练,以建立肌肉。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">とろける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">融化；软化；液化；被迷住；被吸引；陶醉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">トン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">吨（尤指公制吨，即1000千克）；公吨</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">とんだ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">连体词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">連体詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">意外的；出乎意料的；离奇的；可怕的；糟糕的；骇人的；严重的；荒唐的；非常；极其</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"100711\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>非常<rp>(</rp><rt>ひじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>想像力<rp>(</rp><rt>そうぞうりょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にとんだ<ruby>作家<rp>(</rp><rt>さっか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他是非常有想像力的作家。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/737167\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">とんでもない</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">荒唐；离谱；不可思议；令人震惊；骇人听闻；可怕；绝对不行！；哪里的话！；不可能！；荒唐至极！；真是过分！；没门儿！；哪里的话；不客气；别这么说；不麻烦</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"90827\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>歌手<rp>(</rp><rt>かしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だなんてとんでもない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不好意思,她是歌手。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">トンネル</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">隧道；隧穿；（粒子）穿透势垒；滚地球从腿间漏过；漏接滚地球</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183136\"><ruby>汽車<rp>(</rp><rt>きしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はトンネルを<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>抜<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">火车穿过隧道。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">問屋</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とんや</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">批发商；批发店；批发商人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213815\">そうは<ruby>問屋<rp>(</rp><rt>とんや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がおろさないぞ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">答案者不会被打破。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">トーン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">音调；语调；色调；格调</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ドア</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">门；门扉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201824\">ドアをあけてくださいませんか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请你打开门吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どう</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">怎样；怎么；如何</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">同</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">同；同一；上述的；同样；同理</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"189143\"><ruby>英語<rp>(</rp><rt>えいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はドイ