1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">同年级；同班级</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">同居</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうきょ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">同居；共存</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225869\">キムはケンと<ruby>同居<rp>(</rp><rt>どうきょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">金正恩和凯恩同居。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">道具</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">工具；器具；用具；装置；设备；手段；家具</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144319\"><ruby>人間<rp>(</rp><rt>にんげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいつ<ruby>道具<rp>(</rp><rt>どうぐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>使<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めたのか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">人类什么时候开始使用工具?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">動向</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">动向；趋势；倾向；态度</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"145130\"><ruby>新聞<rp>(</rp><rt>しんぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>世<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>動向<rp>(</rp><r